to get Hurt Locker, it seems!</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, it is only a small section but I liked how the concept of using various skills in considerably &quot;violent&quot; ways like Doxxing, Online Harassment, Spreading False propoganda, etc. At least those are some of the themes I felt. It's a great book nonetheless <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1047648-hacking-programming-and-other-advanced-computer-skills?p=1047657#post1047657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For Hacking I use Chase rules from CoD rulebook between hacker and Admin of server. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>This is also a genius idea; I never thought of it like this. Here is a star for you * <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","user":"Volke","date":"02-14-2017, 09:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T18:24:34-08:00","id":1049067,"title":"","content":"I actually use Social Maneuvering for hacking and cracking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-14T23:15:21-08:00","id":1049160,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1047648-hacking-programming-and-other-advanced-computer-skills?p=1049067#post1049067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually use Social Maneuvering for hacking and cracking.</div> </div> </div> </div>Difference between using Social Maneuvering and Chase rules as Hacking is based on what feel you want to convey on game session or how much time you want it to take of game time.<br /> <br /> Chase-based hacking will be 'Hollywood-style' montage in one scene that PCs hack Pentagon in few hours. Social Maneuvering one would be more real world like, when you dig by days for informations on target and get everything by using social engineering.<br /> <br /> For Chase-like hacking I advise one roll by 15 minutes, rolls factors taking in account more powerful hardware and software and that Hacker almost always have Edge, as it he that is 'sneaking' in to Admin's system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T00:10:55-08:00","id":1049173,"title":"","content":"But what about hacking into the Pentagon's computer system while trying to connect to enough wifi hotspots to maintain connectivity during a high-speed chase through a densely-populated city while their allies are trying to keep signal repeaters within range by performing a tag-team free-run across rooftops and the sysadmin is actually in a jet-powered helicopter hopping across several satellite uplinks to do his stuff and heading to the NEXUS World Internet Hub but also grappling with an omnipresent artificial intelligence who definitely doesn't have orange hair trying to get access to the nuclear launch codes in every country at the same time?<br /> <br /> Assuming that the sysadmin isn't inserting notes into the pages as you request them while typing with oven mitts. Which, I concede, would be a pretty big assumption under the circumstances.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-cate